                  "from": 80.270004,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2853648,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Dancing, like other forms of exercise, releases hormones, such as dopamine, which make us feel relaxed and happy, and it also reduces feelings of stress or anxiety.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 104.195,
                  "from": 90.51,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2853676,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Dancing is also a sociable activity, which is another reason it makes us feel good.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 112.159996,
                  "from": 105.68,
