                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2854082,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Current research also shows that dance promotes a general sense of well-being in older participants, which can last up to a week after a class.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 305.99002,
                  "from": 295.055,
