            "question_count": 10,
            "content": "<h3><strong>Health benefits of dance</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>Recent findings:</strong></p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; All forms of dance produce various hormones associated with feelings of happiness.</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; Dancing with others has a more positive impact than dancing alone.</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; An experiment on university students suggested that dance increases <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_31\">______</span> .</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; For those with mental illness, dance could be used as a form of <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_32\">______</span> .</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits of dance for older people:</strong></p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; accessible for people with low levels of <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_33\">______</span></p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; reduces the risk of heart disease</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; better <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_34\">______</span> reduces the risk of accidents</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; improves <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_35\">______</span> function by making it work faster</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; improves participants&rsquo; general well-being</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; gives people more <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_36\">______</span> to take exercise</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; can lessen the feeling of <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_37\">______</span>, very common in older people</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits of Zumba:</strong></p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; A study at The University of Wisconsin showed that doing Zumba for 40 minutes uses up as many <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_38\">______</span> as other quite intense forms of exercise.</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<em>The American Journal of Health Behavior</em>&nbsp;study showed that:</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &ndash;&nbsp; women suffering from<strong> </strong><span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_39\">______</span> benefited from doing Zumba.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &ndash;&nbsp; Zumba became a <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_40\">______</span> for the participants.</p>",
